   "number": 22,
   "title": "Act 5, Scene 4 \u2014 Windsor Park",
   "section": "Act 5",
   "paragraphs": [
    "_Enter SIR HUGH EVANS disguised, with others as Fairies._",
    "_Evans._ Trib, trib, fairies; come; and remember your parts: be pold, I pray you; follow me into the pit; and when I give the watch-\u2019ords, do as I pid you: come, come; trib, trib.    [_Exeunt._"
   ]
